{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12242040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12242040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1224204001:0":{"text":"This is your new supervisor, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"上头派来的新监工，<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35A85F1A4DFB3851","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This is your new supervisor, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"This is your new supervisor, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"140735","variant_female_record_index":"140736","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1224204001":{"text":"This is your new supervisor, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"上头派来的新监工，<style=stress><player_name></style>。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35A85F1A4DFB3851","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This is your new supervisor, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"This is your new supervisor, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"140735","variant_female_record_index":"140736","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224204002:1":{"text":"You... You're that Water Wight who ran away! I got reamed out by my boss because of you!","source_cn":"你……你是之前那个逃跑的水鬼！还害得我挨了一顿臭骂！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1F4B222A9A7F3FE3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You... You're that Water Wight who ran away! I got reamed out by my boss because of you!","female":"You... You're that Water Wight who ran away! I got reamed out by my boss because of you!","variant_male_record_index":"140737","variant_female_record_index":"140738","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224204003:1":{"text":"Shut that! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is our honored guest, not a Water Wight!","source_cn":"闭上你的嘴！<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC2EA20004AC4B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Shut that! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is our honored guest, not a Water Wight!","female":"Shut that! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is our honored guest, not a Water Wight!","variant_male_record_index":"140739","variant_female_record_index":"140740","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224204004:1":{"text":"Also, why is the wood delivery to the port taking so long?! Is life here too cozy that you miss your dockworker days?","source_cn":"倒是你。港口需要的木材为什么还没运过去！舒服日子过太久...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377E095CA5E76487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224204005:1":{"text":"That's not at all the case!","source_cn":"——不不不，绝对没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x630AB1CB5138C50D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224204006:1":{"text":"The wood's ready, and we're bundling it up. It'll be loaded and shipped out soon!","source_cn":"码头那边要的木材已经准备好了，劳工们正把它们捆起来呢，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x161A1A72FC9E60D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224204007:1":{"text":"Actually, we could have done it much faster if some of us hadn't been reassigned to the docks.","source_cn":"不瞒您说，要不是码头那边临时调走了一批人，我们也不至于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E802DDACE65596B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224204008:1":{"text":"That better be the truth.","source_cn":"哼，你最好是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8FA0B23C9A84A08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224204009:1":{"text":"Tell everyone to pick up the pace! We need to get the wood to the port.","source_cn":"让他们动作都快一点，我们等着把木材运回港口。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26EB353BCC9FD368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224204010:1":{"text":"Alright, I'm on it!","source_cn":"哎，我这就去催！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEACBD1012F66AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1224204011:0":{"text":"The lumberyard workers are firing on all cylinders to bundle up the wood.\nHowever, it soon starts to drizzle.","source_cn":"伐木场里的劳工热火朝天地捆着木材\\n但没过多久，天空突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99A7E29F35E80E26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224204012:0":{"text":"Rats... I bet the rain will get heavier soon.","source_cn":"坏事了……这雨待会肯定会变大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA442F050441079AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224204013:1":{"text":"The wood will get wet, won't it?\nThat's bad news...","source_cn":"那会淋湿这些木材吧？\\n这可真是个坏消息……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6152CF45A5547A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1224204014:1":{"text":"Yes—*burp*! If the wood gets soaked, it could take ages to dry out completely! Wet wood can't be used, so it'll lead to more delays.","source_cn":"是——嗝！是啊！木头要是淋了大雨，晒上好几天也未必能干...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71CE25B8D03A73C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1224204015:1":{"text":"Argh! We can't afford more delays!","source_cn":"可恶！不能再拖了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FD39EABA529320A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1224204016:1":{"text":"Mork, I want you to load the rest of the wood before the rains get heavier! Otherwise, be prepared to face Lucca for your negligence!","source_cn":"默克，在雨势变大之前，必须把剩下的木材全部捆好装车！否...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42303C09BBE4F8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1224204017:1":{"text":"Ah?! ","source_cn":"啊？！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D2CFFEEB9C1504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1224204018:1":{"text":"Time's running out! Magister and your two hamsters, you're coming with me to <style=\"highlight\">bundle up the wood</style>!","source_cn":"没时间了。魔法师，还有那两只仓鼠，你们也和我一起去<s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35CEB9DF322794CA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Time's running out! Magister and your two hamsters, you're coming with me to <style=\"highlight\">bundle up the wood</style>!","female":"Time's running out! Magister and your two hamsters, you're coming with me to <style=\"highlight\">bundle up the wood</style>!","variant_male_record_index":"140755","variant_female_record_index":"140756","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1224204019:2":{"text":"What?!","source_cn":"……啊？！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F551ADDD72077B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"Hey, here we are again.","source_cn":"哟，又见面了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26570E17C057B306","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hey, here we are again.","female":"Hey, here we are again.","variant_male_record_index":"67774","variant_female_record_index":"67775","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"You still burp a lot, huh?","source_cn":"你还是那么爱打嗝啊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x200EB2369AF6EEE0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You still burp a lot, huh?","female":"You still burp a lot, huh?","variant_male_record_index":"67776","variant_female_record_index":"67777","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:2:3":{"text":"Don't I look familiar?","source_cn":"我是不是长得很眼熟？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x793E1E2E68EDC433","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't I look familiar?","female":"Don't I look familiar?","variant_male_record_index":"67778","variant_female_record_index":"67779","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮贝拉":{"text":"Bella","source":"血薇帮贝拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工头默克":{"text":"Foreman Mork","source":"工头默克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满&漫漫":{"text":"Chippy & Hammie","source":"满满&漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":4}}